      "value": "Yeah, was just talking to Tupper about this, and this post popped up while I was making a sort of similar post for this subject since he sent me here. I forgot many interesting people's names/id's and couldn't find them again to add them. I was thinking it could also personally be toggle-able through different options, ex: lobby, world, time, date, activity. It's cool seeing someone else mention what I've wanted aswell. Some sort of non-verbal comradery.",
