      "mergeID": "5cc08c55c1557c77df997652",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Would like to see a recent players list implemented for many reasons. The servers are not always 100% and lag outs/crashes are very common. A recent players list would save you time finding that specific server again(By joining off of someone in your recent players if its a public instance)or even adding someone you just met but forgot to send the request. Another great reason is for the  reporting of crashers/violating avatars. The date today of this post is 4/24/2019 and i was just crashed. Due to that crash i made a few searches and popped up here. I couldn't tell you how many times i was a second away from blocking someone to then report but couldn't due to them getting me first. The crashes completely lock up my PC and i'm afraid for its health due to these people who enjoy costing people their time and possibly money in the act. a recent players list would do a lot of good even if it only showed the last 50-100 people. Stay awesome and thank you for what you do.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Recent Players List",
